[GitHub #2434](https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/issues/2434),
where
[`FirebaseUser.getUid()`](https://firebase.google.com/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/auth/FirebaseUser#getUid())
sometimes returns an incorrect Firebase UID.

