DSL](https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/kotlin_dsl.html) to configure
the [App Distribution\
properties](https://firebase.google.com/docs/app-distribution/android/distribute-gradle) with multiple
build variants (build types and product flavors) by adding
`import com.google.firebase.appdistribution.gradle.firebaseAppDistribution`
to your `build.gradle.kts` build script or by using the type-safe
`configure `.

