### Analytics version 21.0.0
- **BREAKING CHANGE:** Removed deprecated ecommerce constants.
Visit the Analytics documentation to learn more about
[measuring ecommerce](https://firebase.google.com/docs/analytics/measure-ecommerce) with
Google Analytics 4.

 - The following constants were removed from `FirebaseAnalytics.Event`:
 - `CHECKOUT_PROGRESS`
 - `ECOMMERCE_PURCHASE`
 - `PRESENT_OFFER`
 - `PURCHASE_REFUND`
 - `SET_CHECKOUT_OPTION`

 - The following constants were removed from `FirebaseAnalytics.Param`:

 - `CHECKOUT_OPTION`

 - `CHECKOUT_STEP`

 - `ITEM_LIST`

 - `ITEM_LOCATION_ID`

 - `SIGN_UP_METHOD`

