`firebase-firestore` library. The Kotlin extensions library has no additional
updates.

### Crashlytics version 18.2.7
- Improved runtime efficiency of the
[`setCustomKey` functions](https://firebase.google.com/docs/crashlytics/customize-crash-reports?platform=android#add-keys),
significantly reducing the number of `Task` objects and disk writes when keys
are updated frequently.
( [GitHub PR #3254](https://firebase.google.com/support/release-notes/github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/pull/3254))
- Fixed a StrictMode `DiskReadViolation`.
