instead.

- Removed the deprecated `FirebaseUserActions.create()` method. Use [`FirebaseUserActions.getInstance(Context)`](https://firebase.google.com/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/appindexing/FirebaseUserActions#getInstance(android.content.Context))
instead.

