### Cloud Storage for Firebase version 19.2.2
- Fixed an issue that caused the SDK to report incorrect values for
[`getTotalByteCount()`](https://firebase.google.com/support/release-notes/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/storage/FileDownloadTask.TaskSnapshot#getTotalByteCount())
