### Analytics version 17.5.0
- Added
[`setDefaultEventParameters`](https://firebase.google.com/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/analytics/FirebaseAnalytics#public-void-setdefaulteventparameters-bundle-parameters)
API to support setting parameters that are logged on all events.

- Added support for disabling automatic screen views by setting
`google_analytics_automatic_screen_reporting_enabled` to false in
`AndroidManifest.xml`.

- The
[`setCurrentScreen`](https://firebase.google.com/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/analytics/FirebaseAnalytics#public-void-setcurrentscreen-activity-activity,-string-screenname,-string-screenclassoverride)
API is now deprecated and will be removed in a future release.

- Added support for manually logging screen views with the
[`logEvent`](https://firebase.google.com/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/analytics/FirebaseAnalytics#public-void-logevent-string-name,-bundle-params) API. This replaces the deprecated `setCurrentScreen` API.

