### Authentication version 19.3.0
- Added support for Multi-Factor Authentication via phone SMS. To
use this feature, you must use the
[Google Cloud Identity Platform](https://cloud.google.com/identity-platform).

- Added a new
[`ActionCodeUrl`](https://firebase.google.com/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/auth/ActionCodeUrl)
class that can be used to parse parameters in action code URLs from
out-of-band email flows.

- Added a new
[`ActionCodeInfo`](https://firebase.google.com/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/auth/ActionCodeInfo)
class that stores information related to out-of-band flows.

- [`ActionCodeResult#getData(int)`](https://firebase.google.com/support/release-notes/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/auth/ActionCodeResult#getData(int))
is deprecated. Instead, use
[`ActionCodeResult#getInfo()`](https://firebase.google.com/support/release-notes/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/auth/ActionCodeResult#getInfo()).

