### Cloud Firestore version 17.0.5
- Added [`FieldValue.arrayUnion()`](https://firebase.google.com/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/firestore/FieldValue#arrayUnion(Object...)) and [`FieldValue.arrayRemove()`](https://firebase.google.com/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/firestore/FieldValue#arrayRemove(Object...)) to atomically add and remove elements from an array field in a document.
- Added [`Query.whereArrayContains()`](https://firebase.google.com/docs/reference/android/com/google/firebase/firestore/Query#whereArrayContains(com.google.firebase.firestore.FieldPath,%20java.lang.Object)) query operator to find documents where an array field contains a specific element.
- Improved offline performance with many outstanding writes.
- Firestore will now recover from auth token expiration when the system clock is wrong.

